  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be really cool to maybe implement a feature to sort worlds by \"Recent\" or \"Top\", in addition to the filtering you can already do via searching by \"Title\" and \"Tag\". My friends and I absolutely love horror maps, but it can be hard to find new worlds because we can't sort by what's new from inside a search itself. We have the ability to see \"Recent\" and \"New\" worlds on the main worlds menu, but more options for sorting a search would be great.",
